    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "A simple configuration to detect when OSC 0 (icon + title) or OSC 2 (title) is issued by the terminal buffer and updating the display name.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"410\" height=\"260\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c844bb31-5ba5-4fb0-b0ff-5322ff52f985\" />\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nvim.api.nvim_create_autocmd('TermRequest', {\r\n  desc = 'Redraw tabline when OSC0 or OSC2 is issued (set title)',\r\n  callback = function(ev)\r\n    if ev.data.sequence:find(\"^\\27%][02];\") then\r\n      vim.cmd.redrawtabline()\r\n    end\r\n  end,\r\n})\r\n\r\nrequire(\"mini.tabline\").setup({\r\n  format = function(buf_id, label)\r\n    local term_title = vim.b[buf_id].term_title\r\n    if term_title and term_title ~= \"\" then\r\n      label = term_title\r\n    end\r\n\r\n    return MiniTabline.default_format(buf_id, label)\r\n  end,\r\n})\r\n```",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">A simple configuration to detect when OSC 0 (icon + title) or OSC 2 (title) is issued by the terminal buffer and updating the display name.</p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/347552/613470694-c844bb31-5ba5-4fb0-b0ff-5322ff52f985.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTM1NTI2MjksIm5iZiI6MTc5MzU1MjMyOSwicGF0aCI6Ii8zNDc1NTIvNjEzNDcwNjk0LWM4NDRiYjMxLTViYTUtNGZiMC1iMGZmLTUzMjJmZjUyZjk4NS5wbmc_.OQuW3JHZ1_uuLBywkwW3F0bEQLihARXYABoKBbuIYn0\"><img width=\"410\" height=\"260\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/347552/613470694-c844bb31-5ba5-4fb0-b0ff-5322ff52f985.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTM1NTI2MjksIm5iZiI6MTc5MzU1MjMyOSwicGF0aCI6Ii8zNDc1NTIvNjEzNDcwNjk0LWM4NDRiYjMxLTViYTUtNGZiMC1iMGZmLTUzMjJmZjUyZjk4NS5wbmc_.OQuW3JHZ1_uuLBywkwW3F0bEQLihARXYABoKBbuIYn0\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 260px;; aspect-ratio: 410 / 260; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"vim.api.nvim_create_autocmd('TermRequest', {\n  desc = 'Redraw tabline when OSC0 or OSC2 is issued (set title)',\n  callback = function(ev)\n    if ev.data.sequence:find(&quot;^\\27%][02];&quot;) then\n      vim.cmd.redrawtabline()\n    end\n  end,\n})\n\nrequire(&quot;mini.tabline&quot;).setup({\n  format = function(buf_id, label)\n    local term_title = vim.b[buf_id].term_title\n    if term_title and term_title ~= &quot;&quot; then\n      label = term_title\n    end\n\n    return MiniTabline.default_format(buf_id, label)\n  end,\n})\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">api</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">nvim_create_autocmd</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>TermRequest<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, {\n  <span class=\"pl-smi\">desc</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>Redraw tabline when OSC0 or OSC2 is issued (set title)<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-en\">callback</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">function</span>(<span class=\"pl-smi\">ev</span>)\n    <span class=\"pl-k\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">ev</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">data</span>.<span class=\"pl-en\">sequence</span>:<span class=\"pl-c1\">find</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>^<span class=\"pl-cce\">\\27</span>%][02];<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>) <span class=\"pl-k\">then</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">cmd</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">redrawtabline</span>()\n    <span class=\"pl-k\">end</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-k\">end</span>,\n})\n\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">require</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>mini.tabline<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>).<span class=\"pl-c1\">setup</span>({\n  <span class=\"pl-en\">format</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">function</span>(<span class=\"pl-smi\">buf_id</span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">label</span>)\n    <span class=\"pl-k\">local</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">term_title</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">b</span>[<span class=\"pl-smi\">buf_id</span>].<span class=\"pl-e\">term_title</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-k\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">term_title</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">and</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">term_title</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">~=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span><span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span><span class=\"pl-k\">then</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-smi\">label</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">term_title</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-k\">end</span>\n\n    <span class=\"pl-k\">return</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">MiniTabline</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">default_format</span>(<span class=\"pl-smi\">buf_id</span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">label</span>)\n  <span class=\"pl-k\">end</span>,\n})</pre></div>",
    "bodyText": "A simple configuration to detect when OSC 0 (icon + title) or OSC 2 (title) is issued by the terminal buffer and updating the display name.\n\nvim.api.nvim_create_autocmd('TermRequest', {\n  desc = 'Redraw tabline when OSC0 or OSC2 is issued (set title)',\n  callback = function(ev)\n    if ev.data.sequence:find(\"^\\27%][02];\") then\n      vim.cmd.redrawtabline()\n    end\n  end,\n})\n\nrequire(\"mini.tabline\").setup({\n  format = function(buf_id, label)\n    local term_title = vim.b[buf_id].term_title\n    if term_title and term_title ~= \"\" then\n      label = term_title\n    end\n\n    return MiniTabline.default_format(buf_id, label)\n  end,\n})",
